@token = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
### Requisição GET
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Requisição POST
POST http://localhost:8080/incidents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Suspicious Phishing Email Detected",
  "description": "An employee received a suspicious email impersonating the company's IT department. The email contains a link to a fake login page designed to steal corporate credentials. The employee reported the email before clicking the link.",
  "type": "Phishing",
  "severity": "Medium",
  "affectedAsset": "Employee Account - EMP-1042",
  "source": "User Report",
  "assignee": "Maria Oliveira",
  "status": "Open"
}


### Cadastro de usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Analista de Segurança",
  "email": "analista.teste@example.com",
  "password": "CyberOpsTeste123!"
}


### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "analista.teste@example.com",
  "password": "CyberOpsTeste123!"
}


### Usuário autenticado
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
